name: sim.getObjectFloatParam
description: Deprecated. See properties instead
luaSynopsis: float parameter = sim.getObjectFloatParam(int objectHandle, int parameterID)
pythonSynopsis: float parameter = sim.getObjectFloatParam(int objectHandle, int parameterID)
